      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: ₹3.52 loss per share (vs ₹9.27 profit in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: ₹3.52 loss per share (down from ₹9.27 profit in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹4.71b (down 16% from 3Q 2025). Net loss: ₹108.6m (down 138% from profit in 3Q 2025). Revenue is forecast to grow 22% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 13% growth forecast for the Chemicals industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 61% per year but the company’s share price has only fallen by 9% per year, which means it has not declined as severely as earnings.",
